        "kind": "user",
        "methods": {},
        "notice": "Immutable, read-only public registry identifying the canonical AXFOX token and basic project metadata. This contract has no custody, no trading, no token approvals, no upgrade path, and no privileged financial functionality of any kind — it exists purely so a project identity/version can be looked up on-chain and verified on BscScan. Deliberately excluded, by design (not oversight): - no owner/admin role - no withdrawal function - no fallback/receive function (cannot hold BNB) - no token approval/transferFrom calls - no proxy/upgrade pattern - no mutable state after construction",
